<title>GERMANY: Strabag says H1 operating performance down.</title>
<headline>Strabag says H1 operating performance down.</headline>
<dateline>COLOGNE, Germany 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group operating performance	    2,620   vs 2,690</p>
<p>    Group incoming orders		    2,660   vs 3,150</p>
<p>    Group orders in hand		     3,700   vs NA</p>
<p>    Group workforce			    22,071  vs 23,660</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German construction group is Strabag AG.</p>
<p>The group said it was not satisfied with its earnings during the first six months of the year but said that it expected its aggregrate performance for 1996 to rise to 6.25 billion marks from 6.1 billion marks in 1995.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
